> Actual source diagnostics

These are captured source measurements, in original execution order. They retain weak results and explicit availability flags. Distinct tasks may use different reward scales; a smoke run does not establish convergence.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/pixel_dqn_diagnostic1.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){auto data=dm::nn::load_npz("build/pixel_dqn_source.npz");auto it=std::find_if(data.begin(),data.end(),[](const auto&v){return v.first=="eval_call";});auto values=it->second.to_vector<double>();auto plot=dm::graphics::RPlot::create();double low=*std::min_element(values.begin(),values.end()),high=*std::max_element(values.begin(),values.end()),span=std::max(1.,high-low);plot.ylim(low-.1*span,high+.4*span);for(size_t i=0;i<values.size();++i){std::string label=i==0?"random baseline,20 episodes,seed777":i+1==values.size()?"final greedy,20 episodes,seed777":"scheduled greedy evaluation";plot.points(std::vector<double>{double(i)},std::vector<double>{values[i]},label,{37+int(i%4)*50,99,235-int(i%4)*50},7);}plot.title("Snake DQN original evaluation calls").x_label("Source call index; distinct policies / seed sets").y_label("Task return").size(1100,600).save_svg("build/pixel_dqn_diagnostic1.svg");}
```
